      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1>Load Images from Folder + Crop</h1>\\n\\n<p>\\n<span data-ic=\\\"workflow-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Load multiple images from a folder, resize or crop them to the selected size, and preview/save the processed images.\\n</p>\\n\\n<hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\">\\n\\n<h2><span data-ic=\\\"nodes-installed\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Nodes Installed from Manager</h2>\\n\\n<ul>\\n  <li>Pixaroma</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\">\\n\\n<h2><span data-ic=\\\"pixaroma\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Resources</h2>\\n\\n<p>\\n  <a class=\\\"pix-note-discord\\\" href=\\\"https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Join Discord</a>&nbsp;\\n\\n  <a class=\\\"pix-note-yt\\\" href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Pixaroma YouTube Channel</a>&nbsp;\\n</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"width\":528.8383221706308,\"height\":591.2463174881113,\"backgroundColor\":\"#2a2a2a\"}",
